'' TKO0362: '#import' STANDS IN THE COMPILED FILE'S HEADER -- before any code, and never in
'' a header it includes, which cannot bring a dependency along with it. The first import in
'' latecode.bas is accepted (and, today, TKO0992); the one after 'print 1' is not.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --pp-only tests/diagnostics/src/modules/latecode.bas tests/diagnostics/src/modules/inheader.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: latecode.bas(3,1): error TKO0362: '#import' must come before any code, in the compiled file
'' EXPECT-OUT: inheader.bi(1,1): error TKO0362: '#import' must come before any code, in the compiled file
'' EXPECT-NOT: latecode.bas(1,1): error TKO0362
